---
/**
 * [INPUT]: 依赖 BaseLayout 注入的主题状态与 data-theme-toggle 事件契约
 * [OUTPUT]: 对外提供带低存在感对比度图标的明暗主题切换按钮
 * [POS]: components 的主题交互节点；由 Nav 消费，状态同步由 BaseLayout 统一维护
 * [PROTOCOL]: 变更时更新此头部，然后检查 CLAUDE.md
 */
---

<button
    data-theme-toggle
    class="theme-toggle w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center cursor-pointer"
    aria-label="Change color scheme"
    aria-pressed="false"
    title="Toggle theme"
>
    <svg class="theme-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
        <path d="M12 21.997c-5.523 0-10-4.477-10-10s4.477-10 10-10s10 4.477 10 10s-4.477 10-10 10m0-2a8 8 0 1 0 0-16a8 8 0 0 0 0 16m-5-4.681a8.97 8.97 0 0 0 5.707-2.612a8.97 8.97 0 0 0 2.612-5.707q.49.326.924.757A6 6 0 1 1 7 15.316"></path>
    </svg>
</button>

<style>
    .theme-toggle {
        color: var(--text-main);
        opacity: 0.6;
        transition: opacity 180ms ease, color 180ms ease;
    }

    .theme-toggle:hover {
        color: var(--title-accent);
        opacity: 1;
    }

    .theme-icon {
        width: 0.95rem;
        height: 0.95rem;
        fill: currentColor;
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
        .theme-toggle {
            transition: none;
        }
    }
</style>
